  "details": "Group banners are always downloaded in their original size (thousands of pixels in a single dimension) even tho they are displayed in small element of like 350 pixels. Some of the friend thumbnails in the right wing too.\n\nE.g. when I open https://vrchat.com/home/groups I download 170 MBs of data which is INSANE for a web page displaying text and thumbnails. The website downloads all group banners in full res. These images can be GIGANTIC.\n\nThis is awful for the user and your servers/bandwidth. It can kill your mobile data limits.",
